OL,3,GNEWSAIsland fossil identified as new
OL,4,Adinosaur species
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new species of dinosaur - a
OL,7,Flong-clawed predator the size of a
OL,8,Flarge tiger - has been identified from
OL,9,Fa fossil found on the Isle of Wight
OL,10,Fmore than 100 years ago.
OL,12,FThe dinosaur, named Invictibellatrix
OL,13,Famberina, is described in a new paper
OL,14,Fin the journal Royal Society Open
OL,15,FScience and belongs to a group of
OL,16,Fagile, two-legged carnivores called
OL,17,Fmegaraptorans.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
PN,33502
SC,0002
