PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1791955590
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAIsland fossil identified as new
OL,4,Adinosaur species
OL,5,
OL,6,FMegaraptorans were closely related to
OL,7,Ftyrannosaurs including Tyrannosaurus
OL,8,Frex but had slender heads and attacked
OL,9,Fprey with their large arms and giant
OL,10,Fcurved claws instead of their jaws.
OL,12,FDr Cassius Morrison of University
OL,13,FCollege London (UCL) said it was a
OL,14,F"real mystery" why the fossil - a chunk
OL,15,Fof the back of a skull - had been
OL,16,Foverlooked in the Natural History
OL,17,FMuseum.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
